eted.","after":"Yes. The parcel acceptance remains completed.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/en/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"en","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"Understood. I've put the receipt and six hundred yen in my wallet. Since I've already left the luggage, I don't need to take it back just to check the change, do I?","after":"Understood. I've put the receipt and six hundred yen in my wallet. Since I've already left the parcel, I don't need to take it back just to check the change, do I?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/en/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"en","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"Put away the receipt and correct change and check that accepted luggage does not need to be taken back. Say it in Japanese.","after":"Put away the receipt and correct change and check that accepted parcel does not need to be taken back. Say it in Japanese.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/en/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"vi","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"Ghi bốn trăm. Không phải hủy phí hành lý mà chỉ sửa tiền thừa đúng không?","after":"Ghi bốn trăm. Không phải hủy phí gửi bưu kiện mà chỉ sửa tiền thừa đúng không?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/vi/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-08"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"vi","turn":9,"field":"translation","before":"Vâng. Hành lý vẫn đã được tiếp nhận như cũ.","after":"Vâng. Bưu kiện vẫn đã được tiếp nhận như cũ.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/vi/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"vi","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"Tôi hiểu. Đã cất phiếu và sáu trăm vào ví. Hành lý gửi rồi nên không cần lấy về chỉ để kiểm tra tiền thừa nhỉ?","after":"Tôi hiểu. Đã cất phiếu và sáu trăm vào ví. Bưu kiện gửi rồi nên không cần lấy về chỉ để kiểm tra tiền thừa nhỉ?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/vi/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"vi","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"Cất phiếu và tiền thừa đúng, xác nhận không cần lấy hành lý đã nhận về. Hãy nói bằng tiếng Nhật.","after":"Cất phiếu và tiền thừa đúng, xác nhận không cần lấy bưu kiện đã nhận về. Hãy nói bằng tiếng Nhật.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/vi/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"id","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"Tertulis empat ratus. Jadi bukan biaya bagasi dibatalkan, hanya kembaliannya dikoreksi, benar?","after":"Tertulis empat ratus. Jadi bukan ongkos pengiriman paket dibatalkan, hanya kembaliannya dikoreksi, benar?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/id/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-08"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"id","turn":9,"field":"translation","before":"Ya. Penerimaan bagasi tetap selesai seperti sebelumnya.","after":"Ya. Penerimaan paket tetap selesai seperti sebelumnya.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/id/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"id","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"Baik. Bukti dan enam ratus sudah masuk dompet. Bagasi sudah dititipkan, jadi tidak perlu membawanya pulang hanya demi memeriksa kembalian, ya?","after":"Baik. Bukti dan enam ratus sudah masuk dompet. Paket sudah dititipkan, jadi tidak perlu membawanya pulang hanya demi memeriksa kembalian, ya?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/id/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"id","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"Simpan bukti dan kembalian benar, lalu pastikan bagasi yang diterima tidak perlu dibawa kembali. Sampaikan dalam bahasa Jepang.","after":"Simpan bukti dan kembalian benar, lalu pastikan paket yang diterima tidak perlu dibawa kembali. Sampaikan dalam bahasa Jepang.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/id/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"tl","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"Nakasulat ay apat na raang yen. Ibig sabihin, ang sukli lang ang itinama at hindi kinansela ang bayad para sa bagahe, tama po ba?","after":"Nakasulat ay apat na raang yen. Ibig sabihin, ang sukli lang ang itinama at hindi kinansela ang bayad sa pagpapadala ng pakete, tama po ba?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-08"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"tl","turn":9,"field":"translation","before":"Opo. Tapos pa rin ang pagtanggap sa inyong bagahe.","after":"Opo. Tapos pa rin ang pagtanggap sa inyong pakete.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"tl","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"Naiintindihan ko. Nailagay ko na sa pitaka ang katibayan at ang anim na raang yen. Naipagkatiwala ko na ang bagahe, kaya hindi ko na kailangang bawiin ito dahil lang sa pagtiyak ng sukli, tama po ba?","after":"Naiintindihan ko. Nailagay ko na sa pitaka ang katibayan at ang anim na raang yen. Naipagkatiwala ko na ang pakete, kaya hindi ko na kailangang bawiin ito dahil lang sa pagtiyak ng sukli, tama po ba?","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"tl","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"Itabi ang katibayan at tamang sukli, at tiyaking hindi kailangang bawiin ang naitanggap nang bagahe. Sabihin ito sa wikang Hapon.","after":"Itabi ang katibayan at tamang sukli, at tiyaking hindi kailangang bawiin ang naitanggap nang pakete. Sabihin ito sa wikang Hapon.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"tl","turn":11,"field":"translation","before":"Opo, patuloy naming iniingatan ang inyong bagahe. Salamat sa pagtiyak. Mag-ingat po sa pag-uwi.","after":"Opo, patuloy naming iniingatan ang inyong pakete. Salamat sa pagtiyak. Mag-ingat po sa pag-uwi.","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/tl/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-11"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-CN","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"上面写着四百日元。也就是说，并没有取消行李费用，只是更正找零，对吧？","after":"上面写着四百日元。也就是说，并没有取消包裹邮费，只是更正找零，对吧？","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-CN/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-08"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-CN","turn":9,"field":"translation","before":"对，行李受理仍已办好。","after":"对，包裹受理仍已办好。","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-CN/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-CN","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"明白了。我把回执和六百日元收进钱包。行李已经寄存了，也不需要为了确认找零而再拿回去，对吧？","after":"明白了。我把回执和六百日元收进钱包。包裹已经交寄了，也不需要为了确认找零而再拿回去，对吧？","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-CN/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-CN","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"收好回执和正确找零，确认无需取回已受理的行李。请用日语表达。","after":"收好回执和正确找零，确认无需取回已受理的包裹。请用日语表达。","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-CN/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-TW","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"上面寫著四百日元。也就是說，並沒有取消行李費用，只是更正找零，對吧？","after":"上面寫著四百日元。也就是說，並沒有取消包裹郵資，只是更正找零，對吧？","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-TW/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-08"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-TW","turn":9,"field":"translation","before":"對，行李受理仍已辦好。","after":"對，包裹受理仍已辦好。","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-TW/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-09"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-TW","turn":10,"field":"translation","before":"明白了。我把回執和六百日元收進錢包。行李已經寄放了，也不需要為了確認找零而再拿回去，對吧？","after":"明白了。我把回執和六百日元收進錢包。包裹已經交寄了，也不需要為了確認找零而再拿回去，對吧？","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-TW/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"zh-TW","turn":10,"field":"hintTranslation","before":"收好回執和正確找零，確認無需取回已受理的行李。請用日語表達。","after":"收好回執和正確找零，確認無需取回已受理的包裹。請用日語表達。","reason":"Postal-counter metadata makes 荷物 a parcel accepted for mailing, not left-luggage storage; retain that context.","path":"src/data/dialogue-content/locale-batches/zh-TW/050.json","turnId":"DLG-SC-LOC-025-06-001-SHARED-10"},{"scenarioId":"SC-LOC-025-06-001","locale":"hi","turn":8,"field":"translation","before":"इस पर चार सौ येन लिखा है। तो सामान रखने का शुल्क रद्द नहीं किया गया है, केवल छुट्टे सही किए गए हैं, है न?","after":"इस पर चार सौ येन लिखा है। तो पार्सल भेजने का शुल्क रद्द नहीं किया ग